---
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>Sisters Oregon SEO Consultant | SEO Services in Sisters, OR</title>
    <meta name="description" content="SEO consulting for Sisters, Oregon businesses that want better local rankings, stronger website content, improved search visibility, and more qualified leads." />
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main>
      <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <p class="section-label">Sisters Oregon SEO Services</p>
          <h1>SEO services for Sisters businesses that want to be easier to find online.</h1>
          <p>
            I help Sisters businesses improve local search visibility, build better service pages,
            strengthen website content, and attract more qualified traffic from Google and beyond.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="services">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="service-grid three">
            <div class="service-card">
              <h2>Local SEO</h2>
              <p>
                Improve visibility for Sisters-area searches, nearby service terms, and local keywords
                tied to what your customers need.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
              <h2>Website Optimization</h2>
              <p>
                Make your site easier for search engines and customers to understand with better
                structure, metadata, headings, and internal links.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
              <h2>Search Content</h2>
              <p>
                Plan pages and content around real search demand, from service pages to local guides,
                FAQs, and supporting articles.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <h2>SEO consulting for Sisters, Oregon businesses</h2>
          <p>
            Sisters has a strong local business community, steady visitor interest, and a lot of search
            demand tied to travel, events, services, shops, lodging, food, contractors, and local
            experiences.
          </p>

          <p>
            I help businesses make better use of that demand by improving how their websites are
            structured, written, linked, and found. The goal is simple: more qualified people finding
            your business when they are already searching.
          </p>

          <h2>SEO services for Sisters companies</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Local SEO strategy for Sisters and Central Oregon</li>
            <li>Google Business Profile guidance</li>
            <li>SEO audits and technical recommendations</li>
            <li>Keyword research for local services and tourism demand</li>
            <li>Service page and location page planning</li>
            <li>Content strategy for organic search growth</li>
            <li>Internal linking improvements</li>
            <li>Reporting tied to visibility, leads, and revenue</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Practical SEO help without overcomplicating it</h2>
          <p>
            You do not need a huge SEO program to make progress. Many local sites need clearer pages,
            stronger local signals, better internal links, cleaner metadata, and content that better
            matches what customers are searching for.
          </p>

          <h2>Central Oregon experience</h2>
          <p>
            I understand how Sisters connects with nearby searches in Bend, Redmond, Black Butte Ranch,
            Camp Sherman, and the broader Central Oregon area. That local context helps when deciding
            what pages to build and how to position your business in search.
          </p>

          <p>
            <a class="button" href="/contact/">Contact Me About Sisters SEO</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
